# CFML (CFScript): Adobe ColdFusion and Lucee documentation: CFScript; requirements/languages/cfml.md
name     cfml cfscript cfc coldfusion
keyword  component function property return if else for in while do switch case default break continue
keyword  try catch finally throw var new import public private remote package required any
type     string numeric boolean struct array query date void
builtin  true false null writeOutput arrayLen structKeyExists len now dump
fold-case
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
string   ' '  : doubled
sigil    #    : attr
operators  +-*/%&|!<>=:?.
calls
